abstract: >-
  An external protocol for comparing program-optimization systems, with curated
  controller timing and frozen-program CPU-scaling observations, provenance,
  offline integrity checks and reproducible arithmetic. The release separates
  observed measurements from claims that remain unproven.
keywords:
  - HPC
  - benchmarking
  - reproducible research
  - program optimization
  - performance evaluation
